Title:          Zerofill
Version:        5.40
Entered-date:   2026-10-25
Description:    Fills empty space on a drive with zeros
Summary:        Fills empty space on a drive with zeros. It helps virtual machine and disk compression software to compact the allocated space in the volume, reducing its disk usage.
Keywords:       dos
Author:         Javier Gutierrez Chamorro (Guti)
